       [
        "Entrance Antiphon"
       ]
      ],
      "cite": "Ps 92:13-14"
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "entranceAntiphon"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "The righteous will flourish like the palm tree, and grow like a Lebanon cedar."
       ],
       [
        "Planted in the house of the Lord, they will flourish in the courts of our God."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "entranceAntiphon"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "h4",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Collect"
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "collect"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "God, our Father,"
       ],
       [
        "who raised up in the Church of Africa"
       ],
       [
        "many men and women outstanding in holiness;"
       ],
       [
        "grant us, we beseech you, the gift of your grace,"
       ],
       [
        "that we may follow their example"
       ],
       [
        "in order to be, one day, their fellow citizens in heaven."
       ],
       [
        "Through our Lord Jesus Christ, your Son,"
       ],
       [
        "who lives and reigns with you in the unity of the Holy Spirit,"
       ],
       [
        "one God, for ever and ever."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "collect"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "h4",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Prayer over the Offerings"
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "prayerOverOfferings"
  },
  {
   "text": {
    "*": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Father of love and mercy,"
       ],
       [
        "receive our prayers and gifts on this feast of the Saints of Africa,"
       ],
       [
        "may this celebration bring us closer to you,"
       ],
       [
        "the source of life and holiness,"
       ],
       [
        "and give us renewed vigour in living our baptismal call."
       ],
       [
        "Through Christ our Lord."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "prayerOverOfferings"
  },
  {
